msgid "You can enable or disable ZSR three ways: double or triple-click the physical Home button (set your preference in Settings > General > Accessibility Shortcut), assign a gesture to \"Turn ZSR On/Off\" in Gesture Actions, or tap the large ZSR shortcut card next to your watch faces."
msgstr "您可以通过三种方式开启或关闭 ZSR：双击或三击实体主页键（在“设置 > 常规 > 无障碍快捷方式”中选择）、在“手势操作”中为“开启/关闭 ZSR”分配手势，或点击表盘旁边的 ZSR 大快捷卡片。"

msgid "ZSR (Zepp OS Screen Reader) is a mission-critical accessibility service for blind and low-vision users on Amazfit devices.\n\nOur mission is to enable independent use of 100% of smartwatch features without sighted assistance.\n\nDeveloped by NVCDevelopmentTeam."
msgstr "ZSR（Zepp OS 屏幕朗读器）是面向 Amazfit 设备盲人和低视力用户的关键无障碍服务。\n\n我们的使命是让您无需明眼人协助，即可独立使用智能手表 100% 的功能。\n\n由 NVCDevelopmentTeam 开发。"

